      "source_location": "L97",
      "source_url": null,
      "captured_at": null,
      "author": null,
      "contributor": null,
      "rationale": "Stop 1 Day 0 member list becomes profiles (Community Manager); Stop 2 Day 1 a member claims; Stop 3 Day 2 the next morning; Stop 4 Day 14 the member two weeks in; Stop 5 Day 14 ECCP's view (Chamber Contact); Stop 6 what a pilot asks of ECCP. Declared once as PREVIEW_OPENING, PREVIEW_STOPS, PREVIEW_CLOSING and SEAT_LINES."
    },
    {
      "id": "_scratch_pilot_preview_issues_03_walk_the_preview_and_hide_later_items_story_bar",
