      "rationale": "Strip under the top bar with 'Day N \u00b7 title', the Seat line, the position, Back and Next; a labelled landmark that announces Stop changes politely; shows no presenter controls."
    },
    {
      "id": "_scratch_pilot_preview_issues_03_walk_the_preview_and_hide_later_items_seats",
      "label": "Seats (Community Manager, Company, Chamber Contact)",
