      "author": null,
      "contributor": null,
      "rationale": "Starts the simulation over, marks it as in the Pilot Preview on that Stop and builds the state synchronously without timers so every run is identical."
    },
    {
      "id": "_scratch_pilot_preview_issues_03_walk_the_preview_and_hide_later_items_tab_memory",
      "label": "Tab memory for reload (rememberStop / stopAfterReload)",
