      "rationale": "Both off in the Pilot Preview and on in the full Demo. Previews off: ComDash shows four tabs and three Overview cards, and AI Lead Agent, Team Dashboard and Engine addresses open the Overview. Pricing off: the View as switcher is not rendered and the view stays Free. Read with laterItemShown, changed with act.toggleLaterItem."
